# Recipe outputs. espnet writes dump/ and exp/ here by default, and this run
# also produced sweep/benchmark variants (dump_pb, exp_bench, exp_phaseb,
# exp_sweep, exp_it0sweep, exp_it0rand) totalling ~28 GB. The real run's dump
# and exp live outside the repo entirely, under /mnt/weka/data/wavlm_expts,
# so teammates can write to them.
#
# NOTE: local/bench/ is deliberately NOT ignored -- those are the measurement
# scripts and logs that justify the batch_bins / k-means settings in the configs.
dump*/
exp*/
data/
